    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "41BB63823CE23FEF",
      "text": "從現在開始，[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n就是藍莓聯盟的新冠軍！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
