      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "41BB60823CE23AD6",
      "text": "雖然我這個輸給你的人\\n沒什麼資格說這話……[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "41BB5F823CE23923",
      "text": "但是讓我們像以前那樣\\n開開心心對戰吧。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "41BB5E823CE23770",
      "text": "能有一分執著去追求勝利，\\n是很棒的事，\\r\\n不論是誰，都是想贏的嘛。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
